# What `gcloud builds submit` uploads to Cloud Build (the Dockerfile's .dockerignore then applies on top).
.git
.gitignore
.gcloudignore
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/dist-ssr/
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
deploy/
.impeccable/
data/
research/
engine/.pgdata/
engine/tests/
